WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.268
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.736
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:05.404
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:05.404 --> 00:00:09.509
When asked yesterday about his
age as he runs for re-election,

00:00:09.509 --> 00:00:12.478
President Biden said that it
doesn't register with him.

00:00:12.478 --> 00:00:15.815
Okay. I know you're trying
to play it cool,

00:00:15.815 --> 00:00:18.818
but you made it sound
like a symptom.

00:00:18.818 --> 00:00:21.054
"My age, I never remember."

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.223
[ Laughter ]

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.891
That's right.
When asked about his age,

00:00:24.891 --> 00:00:27.159
President Biden said,
"I took a hard look at it

00:00:27.159 --> 00:00:29.329
before I decided to run.
And I feel good."

00:00:29.329 --> 00:00:31.965
Listen, we don't care
how you feel now.

00:00:31.965 --> 00:00:34.267
Did you see what eight years
did to Obama?

00:00:34.267 --> 00:00:36.268
[ Laughter ]

00:00:36.268 --> 00:00:37.436
If you get re-elected,

00:00:37.436 --> 00:00:38.771
this is what you're going to
look like

00:00:38.771 --> 00:00:40.406
by the end of 2028.

00:00:40.406 --> 00:00:42.175
[ Laughter ]

00:00:42.175 --> 00:00:45.544
President Biden greeted kids
today on the White House

00:00:45.544 --> 00:00:48.114
South Lawn as part of
Take Your Child to Work Day.

00:00:48.114 --> 00:00:49.916
Unfortunately,
it was a trap set up

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.585
by Congress
to arrest Hunter Biden.

00:00:55.521 --> 00:00:58.458
Former president Trump's
new book, "Letters to Trump,"

00:00:58.458 --> 00:01:02.128
went on sale this week
for $95 -- $95!

00:01:02.128 --> 00:01:03.863
[ Laughter ]

00:01:03.863 --> 00:01:06.566
Let me give you the gist
and save you the cash.

00:01:06.566 --> 00:01:08.567
"Dear Mr. President,
for the last time,

00:01:08.567 --> 00:01:12.371
the Grimace cannot attend
your inauguration.

00:01:12.371 --> 00:01:14.307
We hope this will be
the final word on the matter.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.842
Sincerely, McDonald's."
[ Laughter ]

00:01:16.842 --> 00:01:19.078
A source recently told
"People" magazine that former

00:01:19.078 --> 00:01:21.481
president Trump respects
and admires former

00:01:21.481 --> 00:01:24.217
First Lady Melania Trump
and wants to make her happy.

00:01:24.217 --> 00:01:26.452
But he plans to stay married
to her anyway.

00:01:26.452 --> 00:01:28.954
[ Laughter ]

00:01:28.954 --> 00:01:31.324
After being fired
from Fox News on Monday,

00:01:31.324 --> 00:01:33.292
Tucker Carlson
posted a video last night

00:01:33.292 --> 00:01:34.626
to Twitter and said,

00:01:34.626 --> 00:01:37.697
"Where can you still find
Americans saying true things?"

00:01:37.697 --> 00:01:40.132
Well, hell, you've already tried
Fox News and Twitter.

00:01:40.132 --> 00:01:43.937
I'm out of ideas. I don't know.
Maybe Wall Street.

00:01:43.937 --> 00:01:45.571
[ Laughter ]

00:01:45.571 --> 00:01:48.274
A bipartisan group of senators
yesterday introduced

00:01:48.274 --> 00:01:50.542
the Protecting Kids
on Social Media Act,

00:01:50.542 --> 00:01:54.213
which would set the minimum
age to 13 for platforms

00:01:54.213 --> 00:01:56.883
including Instagram,
Facebook and TikTok.

00:01:56.883 --> 00:02:01.087
Wait, you're trying to keep kids
under 13 from using Facebook?

00:02:01.087 --> 00:02:03.289
[ Laughter ]

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:05.424
What's next? You're not going
to let them wait in line

00:02:05.424 --> 00:02:06.526
with you at the bank?

00:02:06.526 --> 00:02:08.894
[ Laughter ]

00:02:08.894 --> 00:02:12.631
Workers in Wales recently
misspelled the word "school"

00:02:12.631 --> 00:02:14.533
while repainting
a section of road.

00:02:14.533 --> 00:02:17.737
To be fair, this is how
you spell school in Welsh.

00:02:17.737 --> 00:02:23.175
[ Laughter ]

00:02:23.175 --> 00:02:24.944
A court in Germany
ruled yesterday

00:02:24.944 --> 00:02:28.481
that the tenants of a building
do not qualify for reduced rent

00:02:28.481 --> 00:02:30.416
because their landlords
sunbathe naked

00:02:30.416 --> 00:02:32.651
in the courtyard.
Said the judge,

00:02:32.651 --> 00:02:34.721
"Think of it this way --
free sundial."

00:02:34.721 --> 00:02:38.624
[ Laughter ]

00:02:38.624 --> 00:02:40.994
[ Light applause ]

00:02:40.994 --> 00:02:43.863
Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah. Yeah.
I don't need your applause.

00:02:43.863 --> 00:02:45.497
[ Laughter ]

00:02:45.497 --> 00:02:47.066
But I stand by that joke.

00:02:47.066 --> 00:02:49.235
[ Laughter ]

00:02:49.235 --> 00:02:51.204
And finally,
according to a new report,

00:02:51.204 --> 00:02:52.738
trained dogs can help detect

00:02:52.738 --> 00:02:54.874
coronavirus infections
in schools.

00:02:54.874 --> 00:02:57.844
Cats can, too. They just won't.
[ Laughter ]

00:02:57.844 --> 00:02:59.178
That was a monologue, everybody.

00:02:59.178 --> 00:03:00.547
We're off.
We're off and running.

